{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37230","headline":"赠婺州苏员外 · 章谒","name":"赠婺州苏员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝念琼枝欲并芳，星分婺女寄仙郎。\n鸾从阙下虽辞侣，鴈到江都却续行。\n烟月一时搜古句，山川两地植甘棠。\n即看龙虎西归去，便佐羲轩活万方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37230.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37230","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}